<title>UK: USX-Marathon appoints new UK head.</title>
<headline>USX-Marathon appoints new UK head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. oil group USX-Marathon has appointed David Smith as president of Marathon Oil UK and vice president of UK production.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that Smith succeeds John Parziale in both positions.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
